<title>USA: Outlook on Univ of Kentucky revs uncertain-Moody's.</title>
<headline>Outlook on Univ of Kentucky revs uncertain-Moody's.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's on Friday said it revised the rating outlooks on revenue bonds issued by the University of Kentucky from stable to uncertain.</p>
<p>This action reflects the developing nature of proposed reforms, which could alter the governance structure of Kentucky's public higher education institutions including the community college system, currently part of the University of Kentucky.</p>
<p>The proposed reforms also call for increased funding of $100 million over three years to the state's higher education institutions.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
